2a. Persistent workspace IDs and a host registry, for local and remote.
2b. Recovery into the original groups and layout after a supervisor restart.
3. Minimal SSH attachment and portable hosting: x7dr.2 plus 52i4.2.
4. Opt-in managed hosting (host service, Home Manager).
5. Unified discovery and switching, with host and offline states: 52i4.3, widened to the picker, sidebar and Alt+G.
6. Incremental frames with bounded backpressure.
7. Bounded history paging and the end-to-end performance proof.

