Targeted Stop (explicit workspace only; the last stop leaves an empty window with the picker) and reconnecting across compatible builds are adopted as Yu proposed. Their exact text comes in slice 1. Mosh-style prediction (52i4.1) waits for incremental frames.

Evidence: Codex read-only review, /home/lucca/.cache/eon-agents/eon-overseer/pr2/codex-report.md. Co-author credit: commits carrying Yu's design get `Co-Authored-By: Yu Sun` with his GitHub noreply address.

